6 REM data-found is false, so a failing operand or a function with side effects is not evaluated.
7 REM STD 11.5.4 l.8527-8533: the same for the missing-recovery of REWRITE.
10 FUNCTION F$(X$)
20   LET C = C + 1
30   LET T$ = T$ & X$
